cb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VAddhUPd_TAQ7kNvwFAKJC8&_nc_oc=AdqKiJt_tKBe8nLD2wckU6DVw9bulO-BL8JJuvYsrUoiiDI102etmIHTvcG4_xGsKPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSWj0VWrmemC8C2aKsNJ4TrZvASIMMpQS2DVI6PBF1seA&oe=6AF087F9"}, {"file_name": "04-descent-2560x1440.png", "id": "1745832876533724", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823910_1745832879867057_9029806926236221536_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=52lD4kjLR6cQ7kNvwFMq6-T&_nc_oc=AdrRKBCFFQyx-CRgF1Da278z1mto3ngoQjZmW6Q4tp5YZglDgy2_EBG3R94SlQaLu64&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQpPdLFI6zzMV7oFoOXhnpA8_LiI32n3cOhPaTjFp2ivw&oe=6AF0A1B1"}, {"file_name": "05-ascent-2560x1440.png", "id": "3273167679738461", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_3273167689738460_7207507207222469899_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eIyNALDMwDIQ7kNvwHtVjor&_nc_oc=AdqXgUY1ncYRg6CG7ostNSCDRpa_Pn1SzPIijpZC1oaNUXlaw87eRZoYq3EX8C3ckgc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSk3SH96sQHNoKL2uEfF0JApAMy9QXMT839BFPLw8m0Fw&oe=6AF09329"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Vertical Thrust VR", "keywords": ["Thrust", "Escape", "VR", "FPV", "Rescue"], "long_description": "# \ud83d\ude80 Vertical Thrust VR\n\nClassic thrust-based arcade action returns as a modern, immersive **FPV VR rescue mission**.\n\nDeep beneath a hostile alien surface, a fragile life-support pod is trapped inside a network of twisting tunnels. Take control of a compact space shuttle, descend into the darkness, connect to the pod and carefully lift it back to safety.\n\n## \ud83c\udfaf Master the Rescue\n\nFlying the shuttle is only half the challenge. The pod hangs beneath your craft and reacts to every turn, burst of thrust and sudden correction. Build up too much speed and it may swing into the rock. If the pod touches a tunnel wall, it explodes\u2014and the rescue is over. \ud83d\udca5\n\n## \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Precision Flying\n\n* Navigate narrow passages and steep vertical shafts\n* Control momentum with carefully timed bursts of thrust\n* Protect the pod from jagged walls and obstacles\n* Learn each route and improve every attempt\n* Experience every close call from an immersive FPV cockpit\n\nSmooth control, careful planning and a steady hand are essential. Refine your technique and attempt each rescue again as you aim for a cleaner, faster and more controlled ascent.\n\n## \ud83c\udf0c Can You Reach the Surface?\n\n**Vertical Thrust VR** is built for players who enjoy skill-based flying, physics-driven challenges and mastering demanding routes.\n\nThe pod is depending on you. Take the controls, enter the tunnels and bring it safely to the surface. \ud83d\udef8\n\n{1043612228442290}", "short_description": "Take control of a compact space shuttle in Vertical Thrust VR, an immersive FPV rescue challenge inspired by classic thrust-based arcade gameplay. \n\nNavigate twisting underground tunnels, master momentum and carefully lift a fragile life-support pod towards the surface. \n\nEvery movement matters: if the pod strikes a wall, it explodes. Balance speed, control and precision as narrow passages and unforgiving terrain test your piloting skills. \n\nCan you complete the rescue?\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.saxcompute.ltd/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sax Compute Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.saxcompute.ltd/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "rec